    "title": "316L L-PBF fatigue dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6653187",
    "publication_date": "2022-06-16",
    "description": "<p>This file contains 316L Laser Powder Bed Fusion fatigue tests dataset.</p>\n\n<p>Experiments were carried on a MTS Landmark 100 kN servohydraulic fatigue test machine.</p>\n\n<p>This experimental campaign took place in the context of a PhD grant from the French region Pays de la Loire (see https://pastel.archives-ouvertes.fr/tel-03688021 for the thesis manuscript).</p>\n\n<p>Fatigue tests were carried :</p>\n\n<p>- in air or in salt-spray</p>\n\n<p>- on different batches (polished, pre-corroded, with artificial defects,...)</p>\n\n<p>- at R=-1 and R=0.1</p>",
